---
import { contactEmail } from '../../i18n/pages'
import { localePath } from '../../i18n/utils'
import ContentPage from '../../layouts/ContentPage.astro'
---

<ContentPage
  pageKey="entreprises"
  title="Companies"
  heading="Companies area"
  description="Information for companies: national pedagogical programme of the DUT Informatique, map of departments to offer internships or apprenticeships, job postings."
>
  <p class="lead">Welcome to the business page.</p>
  <p>
    You will find on this site information about the DUT Informatique. In particular, the
    <a href={localePath('en', 'presentation')}>presentation page of the DUT Informatique</a> will inform
    you about the national pedagogical programme.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href={localePath('en', 'carte')}>The map of France of the DUT Informatique</a> will allow you to
    find a DUT close to your business and get in touch to offer
    <strong>internship or apprenticeship opportunities</strong>.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can also send us <strong>job postings</strong> to the following address; they can be redirected
    to all of our students (current and former) in France:
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
